      "text": "On this day in 1950, the Korean War began. The Coast Guard played an important role in the war effort by performing a range of missions including port security, search and rescue, and aids to navigation.  \n \nHonoring the legacy of those who served, the Coast Guard continues our broad range of missions as the Nation’s finest military service. Across our borders, and on frontlines across the globe, Coast Guard men and women are safeguarding the homeland. Our members are always ready to keep the American people safe. \n \nClick here to learn more: https://t.co/pqNXbNcx6U\n\n#USCG #AlwaysReady #FinestMilitaryService\n@DHSgov",
