      "text": "The Arctic is closer than you think. The U.S. Coast Guard’s presence in this vital region protects our national security, economic interests, and environmental resources. Our icebreakers enable search and rescue, environmental protection, and defense missions in the most challenging environments. That’s why a massive investment in our icebreakers will secure America’s Arctic presence for years to come.  \n \nWatch this video from USCG Hawaii Pacific to see our icebreakers in action. #uscg  #alwaysready \n@DHSgov @USCGHawaiiPac",
