      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Maritime law enforcement is what we do. Applying our unique authorities, the Coast Guard secures 31,000 miles of U.S. maritime borders – America’s first line of defense.\n\nAs we transform the Coast Guard through Force Design 2028, we are maximizing the return on America’s investment in the Coast Guard and producing a stronger, more agile, and more capable fighting force equipped to meet modern threats. That includes stopping threats at the source, far from American shores, saving American lives and protecting our communities. #USCG #forcedesign2028 #lawenforcement\n\n@USCGPACAREA @USCGHawaiiPac @DHSgov",
