      "text": "The Coast Guard is a Service where you can make a difference on day one—even if you have paws.\n\nMeet U.S. Coast Guard K-9 Buda, one of our highly trained dogs. Buda helps his handler, Petty Officer 1st Class Chase Leamer, search for explosives and keep the American people safe. As the Coast Guard restructures to be mission ready for the challenges of today and tomorrow, we are using every capability at our disposal to safeguard the homeland.\n\nWatch this video to get to know Buda and learn more about how our K-9s help us serve the American people. #USCG @DHSgov",
