      "text": "Our vigilance continues across our southern border and approaches. Applying the range of Coast Guard capabilities, USCG Cutter Robert Yered and @USCGAux rescued and transferred 5 Cuban aliens to Bahamian authorities following a dangerous maritime venture. \n\nAs the first line of defense on U.S. maritime borders, the Coast Guard is maximizing America's investment through cutting edge technology and highly trained personnel.\n\nA vigilant Coast Guard means a safer nation. #USCG @DHSgov",
